# StandGuard redirect map — rebuilt 2026-09-21
#
# The catch-all rewrite (/*  /index.html  200) that served the old single-page
# app is GONE. Every route is now a real file, so a wrong URL must 404 instead
# of silently rendering the home page with a 200.
#
# All redirects are 302 (temporary) on purpose. They become 301 only after each
# destination has been validated in preview and the operator has approved it —
# a 301 is cached by browsers and is very hard to take back.

# ── Old routes -> new homes ────────────────────────────────────────────────
/start-here               /learn                        302
/new-to-guard             /learn#new-to-guard           302
/ecosystem                /learn/ecosystem              302
/academy                  /learn/academy                302
/defi-forge               /learn/defi-forge             302
/stablecoins-payments     /learn/stablecoins-payments   302
/guardian-intelligence    /tools/account-check          302
/faq                      /about#faq                    302
/vision                   /status                       302

# ── Parked features: preserved, not deleted ────────────────────────────────
/shields                  /status#parked                302
/arena                    /status#parked                302
/xpr-journey              /status#parked                302
/signguard                /status#parked                302
/signguard/*              /status#parked                302

# ── Routes that keep their address but changed content ─────────────────────
# /, /guard, /creator, /community, /community/ksto, /community/cyphergang and
# /community/snipverse are real pages at the same paths and need no rule.

# ── Everything else ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/*                        /404.html                     404
